# These dotfiles are checked out natively on Windows as well as on macOS and
# NixOS. Git for Windows installs with core.autocrlf=true by default, which
# would rewrite every file on checkout; pinning eol here means the setting no
# longer matters and LF is what lands on disk everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Firmware image: its bytes are what the sibling .md5 hashes, so it must never
# be renormalized.
*.hex -text

*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
